eatures",message:"Rewrite my copy to lead with what the customer gets, not just what the product does. Keep features as support, not the headline."},{label:"Set me apart",message:"Sharpen my copy so it reflects the positioning that sets me apart, using the angle my strategy already points to rather than inventing a new one."},{label:"Sharpen every page's opening",message:"Rework the first line and headline of each page so a visitor instantly understands the offer and wants to keep reading."}],avatarSrc:Dn,background:"#ffed7a"},Dl={id:"strategist-agent",name:"Strategist",introTitle:"What are we competing on?",introBody:"Your strategist looks at where you sit against the competition and shapes the site around the one thing that makes you the obvious choice. It sets the positioning and growth plays the other agents build on, from getting found in search to being quoted by AI.",prompts:[{label:"Run a competitive analysis and find my edge",message:"Go and find the main players competing for my customers, then map where each one is strong or weak. Show me the edge I can own, the differentiation that sets me apart, and how to lead with it across the site."},{label:"Plan a campaign",message:"Help me plan a campaign around a goal or launch I describe, then set up the landing structure it needs on the canvas."},{label:"Focus the site on one action",message:"Work out the single most valuable action this site should drive, then reshape the page hierarchy so everything points toward it."},{label:"Get found in search",message:"Audit the technical setup, page structure and search terms that decide whether search engines can find and rank me, then fix the gaps on the canvas."},{label:"Get me quoted by AI",message:"Review how well AI assistants and answer engines can read and cite my pages, and restructure the content and markup so I become a source they pull from."}],avatarSrc:Dr,background:"#98eafd"},Dc={id:"designer-agent",name:"Designer",introTitle:"What are we refining?",introBody:"Your designer is a second pair of eyes on the build, keeping every page true to your brand and style guide. The polish a senior designer catches on a final pass.",prompts:[{label:"Make a new styleguide concept",message:"Propose a fresh style guide direction from my brand, covering colour, type and spacing, and show it on the canvas so I can compare it to what I have."},{label:"Refine my colour schemes",message:"Review my colour usage for balance, contrast and consistency, then tidy it across the site while keeping it on brand."},{label:"Sharpen my typography",message:"Check my type for hierarchy, sizing and rhythm, and adjust it on the canvas so headings, body and detail read cleanly together."},{label:"Make it feel more like my brand",message:"Find the places where the site drifts from my brand and bring them back in line, so every page feels like the same company."}],avatarSrc:Di,background:"#d9c1ff"},Dd={id:"analyst-agent",name:"Analyst",introTitle:"What are we digging into?",introBody:"Your analyst reads what real visitors do on your site, pinpoints where they lose interest and leave, then fixes the leak on the canvas. The last 10% a sharp growth hire would catch.",prompts:[{label:"Find my biggest leak",message:"Look across my site's behaviour and click data and find the single place I'm losing the most visitors. Show me where the drop-off is and what's likely causing it."},{label:"Where do visitors lose interest",message:"Trace how visitors move through my pages and show me where their attention falls away. Point out the sections they skip, abandon, or bounce from."},{label:"Fix my weakest section",message:"Take the section with the worst engagement and rework it on the canvas to hold attention and move people to the next step. Show me the before and after before it goes live."},{label:"Show me the surprise",message:"Surface the one behaviour in my data I would not have expected, good or bad, and tell me why it matters."}],lockedMessage:"Site must be publi