.","Tell Relume what you're building..."],esw=[{label:"Plumbing",icon:ef.IconHome,prompt:"Website for Bellwood Plumbing & Gas, a family-run Newcastle plumbing and gas business since 1998. Audience is stressed homeowners who just want someone who'll turn up, so the goal is bookings: phone for urgent jobs, form for everything else. Trust comes from publishing what competitors hide: $89 call-out, $140/hr, fixed written quotes, two-hour arrival windows, 4.8 stars from 340+ reviews. Plain-spoken tone, navy with orange CTAs. Pages: Home, Services, Emergency, Our Work, About, Contact."},{label:"Architect",icon:ef.IconSection,prompt:"Website for Fielding & Mura Architects, a four-person residential practice in Melbourne since 2011 where the two directors run every project personally. Audience is couples planning their first custom build who fear budget blowouts, so the goal is enquiries: short project form with budget bands, no phone. Trust comes from publishing what competitors hide: fees from $45k or 8-12% of build cost, typical 14-month timeline from sketch to handover, every project listed with final build cost, council approval rate. Considered, plain-English tone, near-black charcoal with bold sans serif headlines and full-bleed project photography. Pages: Home, Projects, Process, Fees, Studio, Contact."},{label:"Lawyer",icon:ef.IconPage,prompt:"Website for Essina Family Law, a two-partner firm in Sydney since 2009 where clients deal directly with a partner, never handed down to juniors. Audience is people going through separation who dread the cost, so the goal is bookings: $180 fixed-fee first consult, book online. Trust comes from publishing what competitors hide: fixed fees for consent orders and uncontested divorce, $420/hr where hourly applies, plain-English guides to every stage, average matter timelines. Steady, no-jargon tone, clean sans serif type in ink-dark navy with soft grey and warm gold CTAs. Pages: Home, Services, Fixed Fees, How It Works, Our Team, Book a Consult."},{label:"Gym",icon:ef.IconBolt,prompt:"Website for Ironbark Strength Club, an independent gym in Wollongong since 2017, run by the same two coaches who founded it. Audience is people who hate big-box gyms and want to lift without the sales pitch, so the goal is trial sign-ups: $49 two-week trial, join online in under a minute. Trust comes from publishing what competitors hide: $28/week flat rate, no joining fee, no lock-in contracts, cancel anytime online, real member numbers per session so you know when it's quiet. Straight-talking tone, matte black with safety yellow CTAs. Pages: Home, Memberships, Facilities, Coaching, Timetable, Join."}],esj=n.p+"app/_editor/a/entry_document.file.dad99871.png",esk=n.p+"app/_editor/a/entry_person_1.file.bcf6276f.png",esI=n.p+"app/_editor/a/entry_person_2.file.eef13807.png",esC={header:"---base-intake-project_context_header__header","header-enter":"---base-intake-project_context_header__header-enter",headerEnter:"---base-intake-project_context_header__header-enter",artwork:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artwork",artworkPerson1:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkPerson1",artworkPerson2:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkPerson2",artworkDocument:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkDocument",artworkGlyph:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkGlyph",artworkGlyphBubble:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkGlyphBubble",artworkGlyphIcon:"---base-intake-project_context_header__artworkGlyphIcon",progress:"---base-intake-project_context_header__progress",step:"---base-intake-project_context_header__step",stepIcon:"---base-intake-project_context_header__stepIcon",stepCurrent:"---base-intake-project_context_header__stepCurrent",heading:"---base-intake-project_context_header__heading",supporting:"---base-intake-project_context_header__supporting",headingLine:"---base-intake-project_context_header__headingLine",supportingLine:"---base-intake-project_context_header__s